 "response": {
  "text": "Bilkul. ₹3,000 ke andar **actual running ke liye** main flashy shoes ke bajay cushioning + grip + fit ko priority dunga.\n\n### Meri top picks\n\n### [Decathlon JOGFLOW 100 Superior Grip Cushioned Running Shoes]()\n*₹1,599*\n\n### [Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 Men Cushioned Running Shoes]()\n*₹2,499*\n\n### [Kalenji Men Run Active Running Shoes]()\n*₹2,199*\n\n### [Campus Men's North Plus Running Shoes]()\n*₹785*\n\n### [Campus First Men's Running Shoes]()\n*₹1,099*\n\n**1. Decathlon JOGFLOW 100 — ₹1,599 — ⭐ Best overall value**  \nDaily 3–5 km running, walking aur beginner training ke liye meri first choice. 4.6/5 rating with 4,100+ reviews bhi listed hai.\n\n**2. Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 — ₹2,499 — ⭐ Better cushioning**  \nAgar tum regular running karte ho aur ₹2,500 tak spend kar sakte ho, ye better upgrade hai.\n\n**3. Kalenji Run Active — ₹2,199**  \nSimple, lightweight option; running-focused budget shoe.\n\n**4. Campus North Plus — ₹785**  \nBahut budget-friendly. Casual jogging/walking ke liye achha, lekin serious running ke liye main JOGFLOW ko prefer karunga.\n\n**5. Campus First — ₹1,099**  \nBeginner ke liye inexpensive option; short runs ke liye suitable.\n\nCurrent listings mein adidas ke bhi kaafi running models ₹3,000 se neeche sale par hain, lekin exact model/size ke hisaab se price change ho raha hai. [www.adidas.co.in](https://www.adidas.co.in/shoes_under_3000-running-trainers?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Meri recommendation:** Agar tum **roz 3–5 km road par run** karoge → **JOGFLOW 100**. Agar **5–10 km regularly** run karte ho → **Jogflow 190.1**.\n\nAgar tum mujhe **men/women + tumhara shoe size + daily kitne km run karte ho** bata do, main ₹3,000 ke andar **3 sabse best options** shortlist kar dunga.",
